    "factsheet": [
        {
            "heading": "Chiswick House Gardens walking tour",
            "paragraphs": [
                "A leisurely stroll through the beautiful gardens around the architectural gem which is Chiswick House.  Many features are in place from the 18th century designs of Lord Burlington and William Kent.  See the ground breaking features never seen in England before this date.  See the much more recent Lottery funded refurbishing of the gardens. See the lively wild life and experience the surprising peace of the beautiful gardens."
            ]
        }
